<title>SWITZERLAND: Rieter sees higher 1997 profit, sales.</title>
<headline>Rieter sees higher 1997 profit, sales.</headline>
<dateline>WINTERTHUR, Switzerland 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rieter Holding AG, the Swiss textile machinery and automative systems maker, said it expects an increase in profit and sales for 1997.</p>
</text>
